[
    {
        "text": "When it comes to blockchain, the thing people talk about most the price is actually the least important part. Crypto conversations are too often about who's up and who's down, what to buy and what to sell, and today's drama on Twitter. Most conversations about crypto miss how it's going to change everything, like how crypto app stores are putting pressure on Apple and Google. Or how physical infrastructure incentivized by tokens could disrupt telecom monopolies. I'm Austin Federa, and on Validated, we'll be talking to the people who are rethinking the Internet and our world. No hype cycles, no financial advice, just conversations on the biggest ideas shaping the future of the Internet. Web3 is sometimes complicated, but it's never boring.",
